      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Results gathered by examining 40 patients with temporomandibular disorders and 40 matched controls for craniocervical dysfunction showed that high scores were more frequent for patients with temporomandibular disorders. Results indicated that these patients should be screened routinely for craniocervical problems."},
